{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lbTzpENsfuaCL7xtDgSNtg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:42.323782+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lbTzpENsfuaCL7xtDgSNtg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为了进一步提高上海体育大学经济管理学院研究生培养质量，选拔具有较强的创新能力、科研能力和实施能力的优秀人才，吸引和促进优秀青年学生之间的互动交流，加强各高校优秀在校学生对经管学院学科专业的了解，打造一流的学习和交流平台，特筹划举办上海体育大学经济管理学院2025年优秀本科生暑期夏令营活动。</span></p><p><span>现面向全国各相关本科生培养单位招收学员，具体要求如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2o92r7oQcpmoOF7SVScRbE1p5m5wQRlB4KHUn0kC9POicqpic3RllUbUS4Gafyde02ayG21jkQDMJLkQvENVmVSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、经济管理学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/2o92r7oQcpmoOF7SVScRbE1p5m5wQRlBwT6w3dVhbY2w57N2voOxUOLdP7vc99LkmviaxoyhpGXicLWrNgmZXsoA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>面向体育强国战略和上海全球著名体育城市建设，上海体育大学经济管理学院以国际一流体育特色商学院为愿景，以ACCSB国际认证为契机，以产教融合和科教融汇为特色，致力于培养具有国际视野和本土情怀的“懂体育、善经营、能管理、会技术”的体育商科应用型人才。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><b><span>专业门类齐全，学科体系完整</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院自1994年办学，建设有体育经济与管理（国家一流本科专业）、体育旅游（国内首个）以及市场营销（数智体育营销特色）三个本科专业，及体育赛事运作、工商管理硕士（MBA）等五个硕士学位授予点，和体育管理、体育人文社会学2个博士学位授予点，并开设大数据分析微专业和试点班。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>师资力量雄厚，教研贡献卓越</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院现有专任教师57人，其中教授12人、副教授36人，柔性引进海内外高层次人才6人，入选省部级以上各类人才计划16人次。依托“体育赛事研究中心”等8个国家、省部级研究机构，以及虚拟体育实验中心等5个专业实验室，2010-2024年间，获得4项国家社科重大以及其它省部级及以上各类项目100余项，国家级、上海市一流课程、教学成果23项。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>国际交流合作，育人成果显著</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>与拉夫堡大学、伯明翰大学、拜罗伊特大学、国际奥林匹克学院-伯罗奔尼撒大学等开展联合培养或访学项目，并提供学术交流、课外社团、创新创业等发展平台。学生在中国国际大学生创新大赛（原互联网+）、RoboCup机器人比赛、飞行器设计挑战赛、机器人及仿真技术大赛等比赛中斩获全国金奖，并获得其它学科赛事省部级及以上奖项100余项。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2o92r7oQcpmoOF7SVScRbE1p5m5wQRlB4KHUn0kC9POicqpic3RllUbUS4Gafyde02ayG21jkQDMJLkQvENVmVSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2、夏令营简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/2o92r7oQcpmoOF7SVScRbE1p5m5wQRlBwT6w3dVhbY2w57N2voOxUOLdP7vc99LkmviaxoyhpGXicLWrNgmZXsoA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><b><span>招收对象</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国普通高等院校2026年应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2.达到或接近所在高校推荐2026年硕士研究生免试生要求；</span></p><p><span>3.有体育经济管理、体育人文社会学、市场营销、体育赛事运作、数据科学与大数据技术、信息管理与信息系统等专业背景并有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的科研能力；</span></p><p><span>4.英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>5.遵守学术道德规范；</span></p><p><span>6.鼓励具有跨学科知识背景（经济学、管理学院等）的优秀学生报名本次暑期夏令营；</span></p><p><span>7.招生人数综合报名情况择优录取。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><b><span>活动时间及形式</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.活动时间：2025年7月1日—7月4日</span></p><p><span>2.活动地点：上海市杨浦区清源环路650号上海体育大学</span></p><p><span>3.食宿费用：活动期间学员的食宿由经济管理学院统一安排</span></p><p><span>4.交通费用：交通费自理</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><b><span>日程安排</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2o92r7oQcpmoOF7SVScRbE1p5m5wQRlBib46eNZRia15TKbJNaKtS6eHRmkrYDO2WtFQQb4sxF4p08Ex6nmZhlsQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>材料审核及营员录取</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>审核和录取工作由经管学院党政联席会负责。根据申请人递交材料进行筛选，入选夏令营学员名单将于</span><strong><span>6月24日前在</span></strong><strong><span>公众号“上体经管研途”（微信号：SUS-SEM-Postgraduate）</span></strong><span>公布，并以电子邮件或电话直接通知本人。录取学员需在</span><strong><span>6月20日17:00前确认</span></strong><span>是否参加，逾期未确认视为放弃，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><b><span>优秀营员</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>经济管理学院将为本期暑期夏令营表现优异者颁发优秀学员证书。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>申请须知</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请截止时间为</span><strong><span>2025年6月16日17:00</span></strong></p><p><span>2.提交申请材料（《申请表》及以下证明材料扫描件</span><strong><span>按下列清单顺序</span></strong><span>合并在一个PDF文件中并做好目录）</span></p><p><span>材料清单如下：</span></p><p><span>(1)《2025年上海体育大学经济管理学院优秀本科生暑期夏令营申请表》(申请表需打印出来并加盖二级学院公章，以扫描件的形式添加在PDF中)；</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2o92r7oQcpmoOF7SVScRbE1p5m5wQRlBN0KN9u310LMOIGdoEMjDXuG0yu02DFcEicLZicR5XJA9YaxqVUatjoRw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>(2)本科期间成绩单(由学校教务处盖章)与总评成绩排名证明；</span></span></p><p><span>(3)外语水平证明(如:英语四、六级考试成绩，托福成绩或GRE/GMAT成绩等);</span></p><p><span>(4)其他材料(如:发表论文、专利，获奖或资格证书等)(备注:以上材料在暑期夏令营报到当日需要提交纸质版复印件，同时携带原件备查)。</span></p><p><span>3.申请人需扫描二维码填写问卷，并在其中上传申请材料PDF版（不超过20M）</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2o92r7oQcpmoOF7SVScRbE1p5m5wQRlBeDF27t0wcLUsZPh39IrTDHhtGzYoyichbQ2TWJD0Q5DtrHqhZrGx4ow/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4.联系人及联系方式</span></p><p><span><span>王老师：13798974960</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2o92r7oQcpmammTKW1HeAVm5vFTMs2P0P8qd5Tqib11KkJHbDgQJan00OIPF3tSYr2YXU3R4rxicoOf6suUeoOXg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/2o92r7oQcpmammTKW1HeAVm5vFTMs2P0ZurdvXiblGCkekzLiaPiaqibXxEibB4SJuCocogyG2WC10VxCJBUdpHxEeg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span><